From a11c55a88eb6dbb42544e6b0bc5f02d43e39df73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 17:36:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/98] feat(agents): harden bootstrap compaction and context
 window budgeting

- Add LRU eviction (cap=100) to compaction cache to prevent unbounded growth
- Guard against counter-productive compaction (output >= input length)
- Add per-file and overall deadline timeouts in compactBootstrapFiles
- Use CJK-aware token estimation (chars/1.5 for >30% CJK content)
- Include image token cost in all pre-flight and retry budget checks
- Resolve CLI backend aliases to real models before context window lookup
- Recompute bootstrap warnings per-profile instead of reusing initial values
- Rebuild system prompt report from final active context for accurate metadata

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
